Ink Wars first-party source and the reused ChiChuGames platform graphics code
are licensed under GNU GPL version 3 only (SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only).
The full text is included in licenses/GPL-3.0.txt.

Ink Wars Bitmap is a renamed subset of C1 Package Bitmap / GNU Unifont 16.0.04.
The font data is distributed under SIL OFL 1.1; see licenses/bitmap-font-OFL.txt.
The reused 5x7 ASCII font has the notice in licenses/Adafruit-GFX-BSD.txt.

The maps, terrain icons, unit symbols and commander designs in this project are
original. No Nintendo ROM, sprite, music, map or dialogue assets are included.
Advance Wars is mentioned only to describe a gameplay/interface reference.
